    "detailed_description": "You wake up early, and the sun is already beginning to shed its rays over the skies. But this time you won\u2019t hide away from sunlight. Food\u2019s out after all, and who knows what (or who) you\u2019ll encounter out there? Maybe there is hope for a nocturnal creature such as yourself to find what you\u2019ve been looking for?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet to know a unique cast of characters as you go through your day in Heartbite: Dating in Daylight! Escape from a dire situation, collect candy and witness a decisive battle as you get closer to them. Behold stunning locations, uncover secrets and get a taste of different genre minigames in this dating sim!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThese mini games are a platformer, a physics playground and an old school RPG battle!",
